========================
8. SSH COMMANDS
========================

ssh -i "terraform_keyPair.pem" ec2-user@<PUBLIC-IP>
# Connect Amazon Linux EC2

ssh -i "terraform_keyPair.pem" ubuntu@<PUBLIC-IP>
# Connect Ubuntu EC2

